        <mxCell id="ld-note11" value="&lt;b&gt;Fixture models&lt;/b&gt; (hash embeddings, extractive generator, lexical judge) are the default — every output is labelled &lt;b&gt;FIXTURE — not evidence of model quality&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Production guard:&lt;/b&gt; startup fails if ERP_ENVIRONMENT ≠ local and any of: dev IdP, fixture models, dev scanner, disabled security flags." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#232F3E;spacing=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#D5DBDB;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1">
